message: "If you use EvoFig, please cite this artifact."
title: "EvoFig: PPTX-first paper-to-framework-figure generation with bounded self-evolution"
type: software
authors:
  - name: "The EvoFig Authors"
version: 1.0.0
date-released: "2026-10-25"
license: MIT
abstract: >-
  Reference implementation and released evidence for EvoFig, a PPTX-first
  pipeline that turns a paper into an editable framework figure and improves it
  through a bounded self-evolution loop.
keywords:
  - scientific figure generation
  - editable PowerPoint
  - self-evolution
  - paper-to-figure
  - multimodal evaluation

